      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "一部の魔法は、攻撃や回復の対象を全体化することができます。\r\n\r\n全体化できる場合、ターゲット時に操作ガイドが表示されます。\r\n\r\n全体化すると、1体あたりへの効果は減少しますが\r\n複数の敵を同時に殲滅したり、一気に味方全員を回復するなど\r\n使い所によって、大きな効果をもたらします。",
        "official_en": "Some magic can be applied to all available targets.\r\n\r\nWhen this is possible, “All” will be displayed\r\nwhile selecting your target.\r\n\r\nMulticast spells have a diminished effect on each\r\nindividual target, but can be very effective in\r\neliminating groups of enemies or healing all allies\r\nat once.",
        "real_en": "Certain spells can target all enemies or all allies rather than just one target.\r\n\r\nWhen this is possible, a control guide appears while selecting targets.\r\n\r\nTargeting everyone reduces the effect on each individual target, but it can help wipe out groups of enemies or heal your whole party at once. Use it when the situation calls for it."
      },
